msgid "plugins.generic.scholarBoost.guide"
msgstr "<li>Paper title at the top of the PDF's first page in a large font, author names right below it.</li><li>Text-based, searchable PDF (not scanned images) with embedded fonts.</li><li>Reference list at the end under a \"References\" heading.</li><li>PDF document properties (Title/Author) match the paper, not the journal template.</li><li>One stable URL per paper; do not move papers between issues after publication.</li>"

